{"5068970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "NEXT OBJECTIVE", "steam_appid": 5068970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5068970/extras/494d9993abfc5daf6acf66ae148e04d6.poster.avif?t=1786705388\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5068970/extras/494d9993abfc5daf6acf66ae148e04d6.webm?t=1786705388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5068970/extras/494d9993abfc5daf6acf66ae148e04d6.mp4?t=1786705388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One morning, Tom arrived at school.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everything was exactly as it had always been. Nothing strange happened. It was just another morning.</strong><br><br><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tom was told to go there, so he went there.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tom was told to go here, so he went here.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tom did what he was told.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tom always does.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A completely linear story.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invisible walls keep you where you belong.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No difficult choices. The game has already made them for you.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A yellow marker always tells you where to go next.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There is absolutely no reason to leave the playable area.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Follow the objective.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Follow your destiny.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Die.</strong></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5068970/extras/494d9993abfc5daf6acf66ae148e04d6.poster.avif?t=1786705388\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5068970/extras/494d9993abfc5daf6acf66ae148e04d6.webm?t=1786705388\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5068970/extras/494d9993abfc5daf6acf66ae148e04d6.mp4?t=1786705388\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One morning, Tom arrived at school.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Everything was exactly as it had always been. Nothing strange happened. It was just another morning.</strong><br><br><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tom was told to go there, so he went there.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tom was told to go here, so he went here.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tom did what he was told.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tom always does.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A completely linear story.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Invisible walls keep you where you belong.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No difficult choices. The game has already made them for you.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A yellow marke